 the aiops image; plugins under contrib/ are in aiops-contrib","plugin install appends the bundle with its rows disabled and plugin enable turns a row on: no rebuild and no licence acceptance"]},{"dot":"amber","title":"In process, self-built","items":["Code never reloads in process","The builder fails on a changed release pin, an id under aiops/ or contrib/ from outside, a fake in the graph or a licence outside the in-process allow-list","dist sign writes the signature format of the release pipeline with a key listed under distributions in trust.yaml","A self-built distribution is a self-host path and a working assumption pending the owner's confirmation (W3); hosted runs the release distribution only"]}]}
